flowchart TD
    UI[React / Vite dashboard: 13 named measurements] --> API[POST /analyze: FastAPI routing]
    API --> VALID[Data processing responsibility: typed validation and original UCI codes]
    VALID -->|Invalid input| ERR[HTTP 422: sanitized validation details]
    VALID -->|Valid input| SLOT{Acquire local semaphore within 0.1 seconds?}
    SLOT -->|No| BUSY[HTTP 429: retry later]
    SLOT -->|Yes| EXPLAIN[Explainability responsibility: permutation SHAP on raw feature groups]
    MODEL[(Saved training-fitted preprocessing and logistic model C=0.1)] -.-> PRED
    BACKGROUND[(32 raw development background rows)] -.-> EXPLAIN
    EXPLAIN -->|Repeated model evaluations| PRED[Prediction responsibility: positive-class probability]
    PRED -->|Probability evaluations| EXPLAIN
    EXPLAIN --> CHECK[Check probability additivity; rank all 13 feature contributions]
    CHECK --> QUERY[Top 3 absolute SHAP contributors: decode names and observed values]
    QUERY --> RET[Medical knowledge responsibility: MiniLM semantic search]
    SOURCE[2019 ACC/AHA Executive Summary: official PDF extraction] -.-> CHUNKS[Clinical section filtering: 500-character chunks, target overlap 50]
    CHUNKS -.-> DB[(Versioned Chroma cosine index: 140 chunks)]
    DB -.-> RET
    RET --> EVID[Two exact excerpts: E1 / E2, source URL, checksum and character offsets]
    EVID --> RELEASE[Release local semaphore]
    RELEASE --> KEY{Cloud provider configured?}
    KEY -->|Yes| CLOUD[Recommendation responsibility: one asynchronous cloud synthesis call]
    CHECK -->|Probability and top signed contributions| CLOUD
    EVID -->|Untrusted evidence content| CLOUD
    CLOUD --> VERIFY{Complete response, three sentences, valid evidence identifiers?}
    VERIFY -->|Yes| COMPLETE[Complete result: validated summary shape]
    VERIFY -->|Timeout, rejection or invalid output| PARTIAL[Partial result: explicit unavailable reason]
    KEY -->|No| PARTIAL
    COMPLETE --> JSON[JSON: prediction, all SHAP values, evidence, synthesis status and timings]
    PARTIAL --> JSON
    JSON --> RENDER[Dashboard: probability, signed chart, sanitized Markdown evidence, optional summary]
    RENDER -->|Editing any measurement invalidates old results| UI
